    "Player": 9
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7612001",
      "subQuestName": "Meet Columbina",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761200101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761200101": {
            "id": "761200101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "...Here. This is for you. That's my share done, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200102"
            ]
          },
          "761200102": {
            "id": "761200102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, it's a drawing canvas. Wait, that means...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200103"
            ]
          },
          "761200103": {
            "id": "761200103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Ah. You're just in time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200104"
            ]
          },
          "761200104": {
            "id": "761200104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Maalaus",
            "text": "~!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200105"
            ]
          },
          "761200105": {
            "id": "761200105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, if it isn't Maalaus, our Great Painter! Long time no see!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200106"
            ]
          },
          "761200106": {
            "id": "761200106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, what are we \"just in time\" for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200107"
            ]
          },
          "761200107": {
            "id": "761200107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I just took Maalaus to the moon for a bit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200108"
            ]
          },
          "761200108": {
            "id": "761200108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's sooo jealous of how you just... said that, like you were visiting the garden next door or something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200109"
            ]
          },
          "761200109": {
            "id": "761200109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, what did you go there for? Looking for inspiration?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200110"
            ]
          },
          "761200110": {
            "id": "761200110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "That's half right. We also selected a location for an \"exhibition.\" Do you recall?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200111"
            ]
          },
          "761200111": {
            "id": "761200111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon does! Maalaus's Moon Goddess exhibition! Don't forget to invite us when the time comes, okay?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200112"
            ]
          },
          "761200112": {
            "id": "761200112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes, of course. In addition, Maalaus seems to be able to sense subtle changes around her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200113"
            ]
          },
          "761200113": {
            "id": "761200113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "She's told me that I have changed a lot since returning from the moon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200114"
            ]
          },
          "761200114": {
            "id": "761200114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "That's why she wanted me to take her there, to see if there was something special about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200115"
            ]
          },
          "761200115": {
            "id": "761200115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heh! Now that's an artist for you, alright...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200116"
            ]
          },
          "761200116": {
            "id": "761200116",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, this special thing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200117"
            ]
          },
          "761200117": {
            "id": "761200117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I'm not sure either. I took Maalaus to many places, but none of them satisfied her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200118"
            ]
          },
          "761200118": {
            "id": "761200118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "That is, until I brought her close to your ship.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200121"
            ]
          },
          "761200121": {
            "id": "761200121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "But after bringing her closer, I found that she wasn't interested in the ship itself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200122"
            ]
          },
          "761200122": {
            "id": "761200122",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? What does that mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200123"
            ]
          },
          "761200123": {
            "id": "761200123",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Maalaus",
            "text": "!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200124"
            ]
          },
          "761200124": {
            "id": "761200124",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ohh, she's flying around you, Columbina.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200125"
            ]
          },
          "761200125": {
            "id": "761200125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Haha. She did so back then as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200126"
            ]
          },
          "761200126": {
            "id": "761200126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I suspect that her real interest lies with how I looked after seeing the spaceship.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200127"
            ]
          },
          "761200127": {
            "id": "761200127",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How you... looked?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200128"
            ]
          },
          "761200128": {
            "id": "761200128",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "#Yes. I was reminded of when {NICKNAME} and I went there together.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200129"
            ]
          },
          "761200129": {
            "id": "761200129",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "#We sat atop the ship, gazing at Teyvat. {M#He}{F#She} found the truth about the past, and I found my \"home.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200130"
            ]
          },
          "761200130": {
            "id": "761200130",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Just thinking about it gave me a sense of peace... or perhaps, happiness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200131"
            ]
          },
          "761200131": {
            "id": "761200131",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Maalaus",
            "text": "~!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200132"
            ]
          },
          "761200132": {
            "id": "761200132",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes, you are right. These are not things I would have felt before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200133"
            ]
          },
          "761200133": {
            "id": "761200133",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "So, I told Maalaus our story, including what happened after we reached the moon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200134"
            ]
          },
          "761200134": {
            "id": "761200134",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "She seemed most pleased after that, as if she had found the inspiration she so desired.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200135"
            ]
          },
          "761200135": {
            "id": "761200135",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah. So now it's time for the great artist to work her magic, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200136"
            ]
          },
          "761200136": {
            "id": "761200136",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heh, you didn't take Paimon up there back then, so she's pretty curious what Maalaus is gonna paint too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200137"
            ]
          },
          "761200137": {
            "id": "761200137",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And what are we going to use as paint this time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200138"
            ]
          },
          "761200138": {
            "id": "761200138",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "This time is something special.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200139"
            ]
          },
          "761200139": {
            "id": "761200139",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Maalaus",
            "text": "~!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200140"
            ]
          },
          "761200140": {
            "id": "761200140",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Maalaus says she wants paints that belong only to us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200141"
            ]
          },
          "761200141": {
            "id": "761200141",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And... what does that mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200142"
            ]
          },
          "761200142": {
            "id": "761200142",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I believe she means things that will remind you about this journey, what you have gained from it, and the joy it has brought you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200143"
            ]
          },
          "761200143": {
            "id": "761200143",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Don't worry. Maalaus just wants to see such objects and feel them. She wouldn't use anything so precious as paint.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200144"
            ]
          },
          "761200144": {
            "id": "761200144",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What did you give her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200145"
            ]
          },
          "761200145": {
            "id": "761200145",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Soil from the moon, and the card you gave me for Moon-Prayer Night.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200146"
            ]
          },
          "761200146": {
            "id": "761200146",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Oh, so basically, it's gotta be something that represents this adventure, right? Okay then. {NICKNAME}, you pick!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7612003",
      "subQuestName": "Give the kuuhenki the objects that represent this part of the journey",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761200301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761200301": {
            "id": "761200301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Hmm. A good choice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200302"
            ]
          },
          "761200302": {
            "id": "761200302",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Maalaus",
            "text": "~!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200303"
            ]
          },
          "761200303": {
            "id": "761200303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "She seems pretty pleased too— Whoa, straight to the canvas she goes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200304"
            ]
          },
          "761200304": {
            "id": "761200304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y'know, now that Paimon thinks about it, Maalaus's paintings pretty much cover your story from when you were born 'til now, Columbina.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200305"
            ]
          },
          "761200305": {
            "id": "761200305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And that story isn't over yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200306"
            ]
          },
          "761200306": {
            "id": "761200306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup! And Paimon wants to see more of our great painter's work, anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200307"
            ]
          },
          "761200307": {
            "id": "761200307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Maalaus",
            "text": "!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200308"
            ]
          },
          "761200308": {
            "id": "761200308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, done already? Quick as ever, huh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200309"
            ]
          },
          "761200309": {
            "id": "761200309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let Paimon see... Oohh! This is so pretty!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200310"
            ]
          },
          "761200310": {
            "id": "761200310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon had no idea Teyvat looked so beautiful from the moon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200311"
            ]
          },
          "761200311": {
            "id": "761200311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Hah... Now I can understand why Maalaus says that I have changed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200312"
            ]
          },
          "761200312": {
            "id": "761200312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm? Why's that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200313"
            ]
          },
          "761200313": {
            "id": "761200313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "When I see this painting, I remember...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200314"
            ]
          },
          "761200314": {
            "id": "761200314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "That as I sat on the moon, watching Teyvat, I thought about how I'd always been looking for a \"home\" of my own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200315"
            ]
          },
          "761200315": {
            "id": "761200315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "But now, I suddenly have two homes, both of them places of such beauty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200316"
            ]
          },
          "761200316": {
            "id": "761200316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "It was then that I realized that perhaps \"home\" is wherever the things and people you cherish are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200317"
            ]
          },
          "761200317": {
            "id": "761200317",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A lovely thought.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200318"
            ]
          },
          "761200318": {
            "id": "761200318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Thank you. I think that after this, I'd like to take the kuuhenki to the moon more often.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761200319"
            ]
          },
          "761200319": {
            "id": "761200319",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "You're welcome to come visit my \"other home\" as well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
